</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact001306" name="us-gaap:InvestmentTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80C_eus-gaap--InvestmentTextBlock_z9IeFQIDYsK9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
6. <span id="xdx_820_zAXfwzZAOVc">INVESTMENTS</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">USCF
Investments, from time to time, provides initial seed capital in connection with the organization of exchange traded products (ETPs)
or exchange traded funds (ETFs) that are managed by USCF LLC or USCF Advisers. USCF Investments classifies these investments as current
assets as these investments are generally sold within one year of the balance sheet date. Investments in which no controlling financial
interest or significant influence exist are recorded at fair value with the change included in earnings in the Company&#8217;s Condensed
Consolidated Statements of Operations. As of March 31, 2026 and June 30, 2025, the Company held a total of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--Investments_iI_pn5n6_c20260331__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--USCFAdvisersMember_z1nN1N3pXro7" title="Investment in notes"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Investments" contextRef="AsOf2026-03-31_custom_USCFAdvisersMember" id="Fact001308" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--Investments_iI_pn5n6_c20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--USCFAdvisersMember_z9oDW9WlwGEa" title="Investment in notes"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Investments" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_USCFAdvisersMember" id="Fact001310" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.6</ix:nonFraction></span> million,
respectively, in funds managed by USCF Advisers which are related parties and are included in other equities in the table below. In addition
to the seed capital holdings in these funds, the Company also invests in marketable securities.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

