<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact001629" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_801_eus-gaap--SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock_zyvXst8WTtff" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
14. <span id="xdx_821_zkLD9z1C7ihh">SEGMENT REPORTING</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
its operation of the business, our chief operating decision maker (&#8220;CODM&#8221;), who is our Chief Executive Officer, reviews revenues
and operating income (loss) in assessing segment performance and deciding how to allocate cash and other resources. Asset and expense
information by segment is not reported as the CODM does not evaluate segments on the basis of assets and expenses at each segment.</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact001631" name="us-gaap:ReconciliationOfRevenueFromSegmentsToConsolidatedTextBlock"><p id="xdx_897_eus-gaap--ReconciliationOfRevenueFromSegmentsToConsolidatedTextBlock_zowxgqsRcSVb" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8B4_zzyWmGKzsYG1" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF REVENUES FROM EXTERNAL CUSTOMERS</span></span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
